  "label": "Meme Juxtaposition: Weapon Firing and Stereotype",
  "description": "The visual of a naval gunner firing a weapon is juxtaposed with the text to create a metaphorical 'attack' on the stereotype. The firing of the weapon symbolizes aggression or 'shooting down' the idea that white people are ignorant, reinforcing the meme's hostile tone. This requires understanding of meme structure and metaphorical imagery to interpret the intended meaning.",
